      "content": "Here are four distinct ultra-premium consumer personas for your fragrance line. The first is the \"Established Connoisseur,\" likely European or mature American, valuing heritage and craftsmanship. The second is the \"Modern Tastemaker,\" younger, highly affluent in Asia (e.g., Seoul/Shanghai), who seeks exclusivity and avant-garde design. The third is the \"Discreet Power Broker,\" global and African-American or Latinx, who values understated luxury and personal impact over overt branding. Finally, the fourth is the \"Cultured Minimalist,\" often North American or Northern European, whose core values are sustainability, rarity, and refined simplicity.",
